          exp_desc_1: "The only frontend developer at the IT General Directorate (Dirección General de Informática). Redesigned the Municipal Portal (~9,100 active users and 14,000 weekly sessions) and the EMOS site, starting from legacy platforms with no mobile support. Next.js, TypeScript, SCSS, Docker. Focus on accessibility and citizen experience.",
